 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co.                 MASTER SERVICES\nKG                                                      AGREEMENT\nHauptstraße 42, 50667 Köln, Germany\nUSt-IdNr: DE539304958\nReg No: DE-118955\n\nVON                                                RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG               Müller Industrietechnik GmbH\nHauptstraße 42                                   Industrieweg 7\n50667 Köln                                       50667 Köln\nGermany                                          Germany\nVAT: DE539304958\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 01.05.2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG, with its registered office at Hauptstraße\n42, Köln (\"Party A\"), and Müller Industrietechnik GmbH, with its registered office at Industrieweg 7,\nKöln (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG / Hans Schneider\nParty B   Müller Industrietechnik GmbH / Jürgen Hoffmann\nDate      01.05.2026",
